# Cloudflare Pages redirects — https://developers.cloudflare.com/pages/configuration/redirects/
# Flutter Web is an SPA using a hash router, so deep links live under /#/...
# Serve index.html for any unknown path so the SPA bootstraps correctly.
#
# Note: /api/* is served by the Pages Function at functions/api/[[catchall]].js
# (CORS proxy for the dashboard API). Pages Functions take precedence over
# these redirects, so no exclusion rule is needed here.
/*    /index.html   200
